    <tags>openrom retro gaming emulation rom chd cso rvz patcher</tags>
    <summary>Universal Retro Gaming and ROM Management Toolkit</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[OpenROM is a free, open-source universal toolkit to convert, compress, and patch ROMs.
Features include batch conversion (ISO to CHD/CSO/RVZ), M3U playlist generation, BIN track merging, and support for 9 ROM patch formats (IPS, BPS, UPS, xdelta3, etc.).]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/M5Devs/OpenROM/releases/tag/v3.9.5</releaseNotes>
